+# Plan — count private contributions on the stats card
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 The endpoint with count_private adds the private contributions to the card's total commits and rank (tests/api.test.js::`Test /api/ > should add private contributions`) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 fetchStats with count_private adds the private contributions to totalCommits (tests/fetchStats.test.js::`Test fetchStats > should fetch and add private contributions`) [AC-2]
+
+## 2. The option
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Query restrictedContributionsCount, and add it to totalCommits when count_private is set (src/fetchStats.js)
+- [ ] 2.2 Read count_private on `/api` and pass it to fetchStats (api/index.js)
+- [ ] 2.3 Document count_private (readme.md)
